{"condensed":"Builds the email for annual report reminder notification to a business.

Entry point: `process(email_msg, token, flag_on)` — no check shown. Receives email_msg with arFee, arYear, businessId; token for authorization; flag_on boolean. Reads AR-REMINDER.html template from TEMPLATE_PATH config, substitutes template parts. Queries Business by businessId and its CorpType by legal_type. Renders Jinja2 template with business.json(), ar_fee, ar_year, entity_type (corp_type.full_desc), entity_dashboard_url (DASHBOARD_URL + business.identifier), and disable_specific_service_provider (flag_on). Calls get_recipient_from_auth(business.identifier, token) to fetch recipients. Returns dict with recipients, requestBy='BCRegistries@gov.bc.ca', content (subject combining business.legal_name and ar_year, body as rendered HTML, empty attachments list).

