42244.text:
{"condensed":"Defines ORM model and schema for invoice reference status codes, a master data lookup table.

InvoiceReferenceStatusCode is a database table with two fields: code (string, primary key, max 20 chars) and description (string, max 200 chars, required). The mapper explicitly includes only these two fields to tolerate schema drift during rolling upgrades or failed deployments, letting old and new service versions run simultaneously. InvoiceReferenceStatusCodeSchema serializes the model using Marshmallow's SQLAlchemy auto-schema with load_instance=True.

No entry points, queries, or mutations are defined in this chunk—it is a data model only. This chunk shows no permission checks, no duplicate guards, and no validation beyond the nullable constraint on description.","defines":["InvoiceReferenceStatusCode","InvoiceReferenceStatusCodeSchema","invoice_reference_status_codes"],"uses":[{"name":"CodeTable","direction":"reads","what":"Base class for status codes"},{"name":"db.Model","direction":"reads","what":"SQLAlchemy declarative model base"},{"name":"ma.SQLAlchemyAutoSchema","direction":"reads","what":"Marshmallow schema generator for SQLAlchemy models"},{"name":"db.Column","direction":"reads","what":"SQLAlchemy column definition"},{"name":"db.String","direction":"reads","what":"SQLAlchemy string type"}]}

42274.text:
{"condensed":"Defines the TransactionStatusCode model and schema for master data management of transaction status codes.

The model manages a code table mapping transaction status codes to descriptions. Incoming data consists of a code (String, max 20 chars, primary key) and description (String, max 200 chars, non-nullable). The schema serializes these fields to JSON for API responses. The mapper explicitly includes only 'code' and 'description' properties to handle rolling upgrades where service versions differ—this prevents SQLAlchemy errors when additional fields exist from failed deploys or upgrades. No entry points, no authorization checks, and no outbound calls are shown in this chunk.

